@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process Sale"

[*] --> WaitingForSale

state "Waiting for a new sale" as WaitingForSale
state "Enter items one by one" as EnterItems
state "Move to payment" as MoveToPayment
state "Complete sale immediately if cash is used" as CompleteSaleCash
state "Verify payment if card or check is used" as VerifyPayment
state "Complete sale once payment is approved" as CompleteSaleApproved
state "Return to waiting for next customer" as ReturnToWaiting

WaitingForSale --> EnterItems : new sale started
EnterItems --> MoveToPayment : all items added
MoveToPayment --> CompleteSaleCash : cash used
CompleteSaleCash --> ReturnToWaiting : immediate completion
MoveToPayment --> VerifyPayment : card or check used
VerifyPayment --> CompleteSaleApproved : payment approved
CompleteSaleApproved --> ReturnToWaiting : sale completed

@enduml
